":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-19T15:15:07-07:00","id":1209023,"title":"","content":"I use contemporary setting. So in the modern nights I don't see why you couldn't just include Patreon, Kickstarter, Go Fund Me. Heck, there's a vampire in our current campaign that use to be a socialite and heiress in the style of Kim Kardashian/Paris Hilton that has a couple million followers on Twitter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23951-acwrig2","name":"acwrig2","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-19T17:48:38-07:00","id":1209074,"title":"","content":"I imagine a lot more medical expense related Go-Fund-Mes in a darker world, due to more exclusions, less people affording insurance personally and workplaces cutting everything they can.<br /> But in a worse than real life way....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16927-illithid","name":"Illithid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16927_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-19T17:58:57-07:00","id":1209076,"title":"","content":"There is a 'crowdfunded diva' character in the Mage Revised Syndicate Convention book. I'd expect we have similar crowd-funding sources and a few that are serious rip-offs. Flamewars over games that are let could get really nasty, especially if a supernatural was involved.<br /> <br /> 'It's been four years since that *expletive deleted* promised that game to us. He hasn't delivered. Well, then we should ensorcel him to suffer. . .'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-19T18:15:17-07:00","id":1209080,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I'd imagine the World of Darkness would have more crowd-fund scams.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-20T15:28:04-07:00","id":1209422,"title":"","content":"Hello, I am a poor vampire who cannot afford a Haven. I'm currently trying to raise funds to construct an underground vault. Contribute now and be welcomed to the grand opening party/food stock piling drive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://foru